    "Choose a window and capture it without the surrounding desktop." : {

    },
    "Choose Add in a one-image Screenshot. The chooser explains each result: Compare shows Before and After together or highlights changes; Add as Step puts captures in order for captions and numbering; Combine arranges captures and images as one result. Region is ready by default, and the menu can preselect another source. The purpose changes only after the source is added successfully, and Undo returns to the original Screenshot. Later additions inherit the purpose without asking again. Option-Command-A invokes the same contextual action." : {

    },
    "Choose an annotation or drawing tool to see its properties." : {

    },
    "Choose Annotate Result to place annotations above the arranged items and below optional Polish. Anchored endpoints follow their items through layout changes; Pin Selection to Canvas keeps them in the overall result. Canvas bounds remain in Arrange." : {

