    },
    "Use Quick Capture when you want a one-action Screenshot from Region, Window, Screen, Scrolling Content, a repeat, or a preset. Scroll and Repeat Last are direct actions; Presets stays in its own menu. Under Create, choose Comparison, Steps, or Combined Image to open setup with the result already selected. Under Record, choose Region, Window, Screen, Guide, or an available connected device directly. Use Screen Tools for Screen Ruler, Screen Inspector, and Quick Controls, and open Clipboard History beside them." : {

